# Implementation plan — Spec 1.12.0

## Summary

Add a standalone **`sms/`** microservice (cloned from `email/`) that queues text/OTP messages and exposes a **device API**, plus a new **`mobile/`** Expo app (React Native + React Native Web) whose v1 scope is **login + configure this phone as an SMS gateway**. The phone SIM is the transport: devices poll for scoped pending messages and send them via `SmsManager`. Super admins register **platform** devices (system SMS); company owners register **company** devices (their SMS).

See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-sms-service-scaffold.md](./02-sms-service-scaffold.md), [03-gateway-and-sending-engine.md](./03-gateway-and-sending-engine.md), [04-mobile-app.md](./04-mobile-app.md), [05-platform-integration.md](./05-platform-integration.md), [06-sms-templates.md](./06-sms-templates.md).

| Project | Touch |
|---------|--------|
| `sms/` | New FE (admin) + BE + migrations; primary scope |
| `mobile/` | New Expo app — login + gateway config |
| `identity/backend/` | Optional `smsClient.service.ts` phone OTP |
| `webonone-v2/` | Optional SMS nav / company send |
| root `package.json` | `sms/` + `mobile/` workspaces, `dev:sms`, `build:sms`, `mobile*` |

