## Phase 2 — Gateway + sending engine

**Goal:** [03-gateway-and-sending-engine.md](./03-gateway-and-sending-engine.md) — queue, OTP, device API, scope routing, reaper, internal API.

**Exit criteria:** scoped claim works via `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED`; status writes `sms_history`; OTP verify enforces expiry + attempts.

| Task | Paths / detail |
|------|----------------|
| Domain migrations | `sms_devices` (scope/company_id/device_key_hash/status/sim_slots), `sms_templates`(+versions), `sms_queue` (scope, assigned_device_id), `sms_history`, `sms_otps`, `sms_audit_log`; seed platform `otp`/`phone_verification`/`password_reset`/`generic` |
| Templates (system + company) | scope/override resolution, role-scoped CRUD (server-derived scope/company_id), char/segment counter — [06-sms-templates.md](./06-sms-templates.md) |
| Queue service | enqueue → resolve template (company override → platform) → render `{{key}}` → insert `pending` with scope |
| Device routes | `POST /device/register` (scope from user JWT), `/heartbeat`, `GET /device/messages` (scoped claim), `POST /device/messages/:id/status` |
| OTP service | 6-digit, SHA-256 hash, `OTP_TTL_SECONDS`, attempt limit; send via `otp` template |
| Reaper | `workers/reaper.ts`: un-stick processing, retry backoff `[60s,300s,900s]`, offline devices, expire OTPs |
| Internal API | `POST /internal/send`, `/internal/otp/send`, `/internal/otp/verify` |
| Public API | send/test, otp send/verify, devices admin (approve/revoke), queue/history, templates, dashboard |

**Verify:** `npm run migrate -w sms-root`; simulate a device claim with a curl using a device key.

