## Risks and open items

- **Battery/doze:** Android may kill the foreground service; document battery-optimization exemption; consider WorkManager fallback.
- **Carrier limits:** SIMs throttle bulk SMS; add per-device rate limiting (future) and surface failures.
- **Expo Go unsupported:** native SMS module needs a dev/prebuild build — not Expo Go.
- **Monorepo Metro:** workspace hoisting can break Metro resolution; pin `metro.config.js` watchFolders/nodeModulesPaths.
- **ClickUp IDs:** placeholders `TBD` until the 1.12.0 user story + subtasks are created.

